# ── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Broad env coverage, not just .env.local — one mis-named file is a public
# leak (this repo is public; see docs/security-audit.md).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Release signing material. Committing a keystore hands over the ability to
# ship a malicious update as us — it can never be rotated for installed users.
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties
key.properties
google-services.json.bak
*.p12
*.pem
*.mobileprovision

# Pose videos — hosted in Supabase Storage, not bundled (see docs/pose-videos.md)
media/pose-videos/
public/poses/*.mp4

# Recovered source PNGs for Kling/Nano Banana (local only, not bundled)
media/pose-source-png/
